data: {"delta":"C. Joseph Vijay is the current Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu. He was sworn in on May 9, 2026, after the political uncertainty following the state elections [3, 4]. Vijay, a popular Tamil film actor who transitioned to politics, is also noted for being the first Christian to hold this position in Tamil Nadu [5]. He leads the TVK party and is the youngest Chief Minister in the state's history [6].","conversationId":"cmvomrbsr000ztptuttoof99u"}

